{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-003", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef merge_slots(slots: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    result: list[list[int]] = []\n    for start, end in sorted(slots, key=lambda s: s[0]):\n        if result and start <= result[-1][1]:\n            result[-1][1] = max(result[-1][1], end)\n        else:\n            result.append([start, end])\n    return result\n```"}}]}}}
