{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-005", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef stair_ways(n: int, broken: list[int]) -> int:\n    MOD = 1000000007\n    bad = set(broken)\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i in bad:\n            continue\n        dp[i] = dp[i - 1]\n        if i >= 2:\n            dp[i] += dp[i - 2]\n        dp[i] %= MOD\n    return dp[n]\n```"}}]}}}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-006", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef rle_decode(s: str) -> str:\n    out = []\n    num = \"\"\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch.isdigit():\n            num += ch\n        else:\n            out.append(ch * (int(num) if num else 1))\n            num = \"\"\n    return \"\".join(out)\n```"}}]}}}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-007", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef grid_islands(grid: list[str]) -> list[int]:\n    rows = len(grid)\n    seen = [[False] * len(row) for row in grid]\n    sizes = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(len(grid[r])):\n            if grid[r][c] == '#' and not seen[r][c]:\n                seen[r][c] = True\n                stack = [(r, c)]\n                size = 0\n                while stack:\n                    y, x = stack.pop()\n                    size += 1\n                    for dy, dx in ((1, 0), (-1, 0), (0, 1), (0, -1)):\n                        ny, nx = y + dy, x + dx\n                        if 0 <= ny < rows and 0 <= nx < len(grid[ny]) and grid[ny][nx] == '#' and not seen[ny][nx]:\n                            seen[ny][nx] = True\n                            stack.append((ny, nx))\n                sizes.append(size)\n    return sorted(sizes, reverse=True)\n```"}}]}}}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-008", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef next_bus(times: list[str], now: str) -> str:\n    def to_min(t: str) -> int:\n        h, m = t.split(\":\")\n        return int(h) * 60 + int(m)\n    current = to_min(now)\n    ordered = sorted(times, key=to_min)\n    for t in ordered:\n        if to_min(t) >= current:\n            return t\n    return ordered[0]\n```"}}]}}}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-009", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef bracket_depth(s: str) -> int:\n    pairs = {')': '(', ']': '[', '}': '{'}\n    stack = []\n    depth = 0\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in '([{':\n            stack.append(ch)\n            depth = max(depth, len(stack))\n        elif ch in pairs:\n            if not stack or stack[-1] != pairs[ch]:\n                return -1\n            stack.pop()\n    if stack:\n        return -1\n    return depth\n```"}}]}}}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "question_id": "code-010", "attempt": 1, "source": "Claude Code の担当（model=haiku, effort=low）。API ではなく、61 問を 1 回の会話で道具なしに解かせた", "request": {"method": null, "url": null, "headers": {}, "body": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low"}}, "sent_at": "2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+00:00", "received_at": null, "elapsed_ms": null, "error": null, "response": {"status": 200, "headers": [], "body_text": null, "body_json": {"choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef split_bill(total: int, weights: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    W = sum(weights)\n    shares = [total * w // W for w in weights]\n    rem = total - sum(shares)\n    order = sorted(range(len(weights)), key=lambda i: (-((total * weights[i]) % W), i))\n    for i in order[:rem]:\n        shares[i] += 1\n    return shares\n```"}}]}}}
